An explorer discovered a secure vault. There is a sequence of levers on the entrance panel, and the correct lever to open the door must be found based on the following conditions:
1. B is positioned to the right of A;
2. B is the third to the right of C;
3. C is to the right of D;
4. D is immediately next to E;
5. There is one lever between E and A.

An explorer discovered a locked treasure cave. There is a row of buttons on the door, and the correct button to open the door must be found based on the following conditions:
1. A is to the left of B;
2. B is the third to the right of C;
3. C is to the right of D;
4. D is immediately next to E;
5. There is one button between E and A.
